<!--
    English = default and fallback for every phone language other than German, Japanese, Dutch and Romanian.
    Tone like the German original: plain words for non-experts, direct "you".
    Unchanged in every language: XCB, Core, CorePass, Catch That Rabbit, TMMAC, H/s, PPLNS.
    The developer log (Details and log) stays German on purpose: it comes partly from miner-core
    (no Android resources) and evaluation scripts grep for its wording.
-->
